bell_chime.wav ("Wind chimes")
  Model: eleven_text_to_sound_v3, 6 s requested, loop off, prompt influence 0.6.
  Prompt: "A set of six aluminium wind chimes of different lengths and pitches, from low to high, struck irregularly by a gentle breeze: several tubes ring at once and overlap in a random, sparse pattern over the first few seconds, then all ring out and fade naturally to silence. Clear metallic tones, many distinct notes. Close, dry, no wind noise, no rumble, no background, no music."
  Take 4 of 10, generated 2026-11-25. Plan: ElevenLabs Creator (paid).
  Changes: cut to 0.07-5.8 s of the take, high-passed at 300 Hz,
  faded in and out, peak-limited, levelled, converted to mono 16-bit PCM
  WAV, 22050 Hz.

pulse_heartbeat.wav ("Heartbeat")
  Model: eleven_text_to_sound_v3, 2 s requested, loop off, prompt influence 0.5.
  Prompt: "One single human heartbeat recorded through a stethoscope: a low soft 'lub' followed a quarter second later by a slightly higher, shorter 'dub', then silence. Only one beat. Warm, deep, dry, close. No music, no hiss, no beeps."
  Take 2 of 4, generated 2026-11-11. Plan: ElevenLabs Creator (paid).
  Changes: cut to 0.495-1.13 s of the take, high-passed at 25 Hz,
  faded in and out, levelled, converted to mono 16-bit PCM WAV, 44100 Hz.

